(BUREAU OF INDIAN STANDARDS) Tj
T*
(FOREIGN MANUFACTURERS CERTIFICATION SCHEME \(FMCS\)) Tj
T*
(Notification No. BIS/FMCS/2018/001) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SCOPE AND APPLICABILITY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The Foreign Manufacturers Certification Scheme \(FMCS\) enables manufacturers located outside) Tj
T*
(India ) Tj
T*
(to apply for and obtain a BIS certification mark \(Standard Mark or ISI mark\) for products ) Tj
T*
(intended for sale in India without establishing a presence in India.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LEGAL AUTHORITY: Bureau of Indian Standards Act, 2016, Section 14\(1\)\(d\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MANDATORY PRODUCTS UNDER FMCS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Products under Quality Control Orders \(QCOs\) manufactured abroad require FMCS license before ) Tj
T*
(customs clearance. Key categories include:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. AUTOMOTIVE ELECTRONICS) Tj
T*
(   - Engine Control Units \(ECU\): IS 16046 \(Part 2\):2018 | HS Code 8542.31) Tj
T*
(   - Electronic Fuel Injection Systems: IS 16046 | HS Code 8542.31) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. ELECTRONICS & IT EQUIPMENT  ) Tj
T*
(   - LED Lamps and Light-Emitting Diodes: IS 15844:2010 | HS Code 8541.40) Tj
T*
(   - Portable IT Equipment: IS 13252 \(Part 1\):2010 | HS Code 8471.30) Tj
T*
(   - Smartphones: IS 13252 \(Part 1\):2010 | HS Code 8517.13) Tj
T*
(   - Power Inverters: IS 13252 \(Part 1\):2010 | HS Code 8504.40.90) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. ELECTRICAL APPLIANCES) Tj
T*
(   - Electric Water Heaters \(Geysers\): IS 2082:2018 | HS Code 8516.10) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. METALS & CONSTRUCTION) Tj
T*
(   - Hot-Rolled Structural Steel: IS 2062:2011 | HS Code 7216.10) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. SAFETY EQUIPMENT) Tj
T*
(   - Two-Wheeler Helmets: IS 4151:2015 | HS Code 6506.10) Tj
T*
(   - Bicycle Frames: IS 623:2025 | HS Code 8714.91) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. PLUMBING & VALVES) Tj
T*
(   - Pressure Relief Valves: IS 778:2019 | HS Code 8481.80) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. MEDICAL DEVICES) Tj
T*
(   - Clinical Thermometers: IS 3055 \(Part 1\):1994 | HS Code 9018.19) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SCHEME TYPES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SCHEME-I \(FMCS\): Product Certification with factory inspection. ISI Mark granted.) Tj
T*
(SCHEME-II \(CRS\): Compulsory Registration Scheme. Simplified procedure for electronics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(APPLICATION FEES \(2026 Schedule\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Application Fee \(non-refundable\): 30,000) Tj
T*
(Processing Fee: 15,000 for CRS | 30,000 for FMCS Scheme-I) Tj
T*
(Marking Fee: Variable by IS standard and enterprise type \(see fee matrix\)) Tj
T*
(BIS Officer Travel: Reimbursable actual costs \(see zone-wise schedule\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PROCESSING TIMELINE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CRS \(Scheme-II\): 12-16 weeks) Tj
T*
(FMCS Scheme-I: 16-24 weeks \(depends on travel zone and lab queue\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EFFECTIVE DATE: January 1, 2018) Tj
T*
(AMENDED: March 15, 2024 \(Zone Americas travel fee revision\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
